<div class="nur-seo" lang="en">
  <section class="nur-seo__row">
    <div class="nur-seo__label"><span class="nur-seo__idx">The idea</span><h2>Why a fixed programme is a guess</h2></div>
    <div>
      <p class="nur-seo__lead">An LED mask ships with a set of programmes. The user picks one and repeats it, week after week. Texture, breakouts, redness and fine lines rarely call for the same wavelength in the same order.</p>
      <p>NŪR Protocol moves that choice into the app: NŪR Skincoach assesses your skin, and that assessment gives your personalised LED routine, week after week. The LED mask treats the face and the neck.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="nur-seo__row">
    <div class="nur-seo__label"><span class="nur-seo__idx">NŪR Skincoach</span><h2>NŪR Skincoach: from your skin assessment to your personalised routine</h2></div>
    <div>
      <p>The assessment changes how you use the mask: a few questions in the app, plus a selfie if you choose, return a personalised skincare routine, not just a score.</p>
